      "text": "## The Big Picture"
    },
    {
      "id": "15-OPTIMIZATION.md#002",
      "path": [
        "15-OPTIMIZATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:mathematics:15-optimization, git-history:mathematics:15-optimization]",
        "canonical_path": "mathematics/15-OPTIMIZATION.md",
        "concepts": "[optimization]",
        "current_path": "mathematics/15-OPTIMIZATION.md",
        "id": "maxim:mathematics:optimization",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "mathematics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[optimization]",
        "section": "mathematics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Optimization - Complete Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                         OPTIMIZATION LANDSCAPE                              │\n│              minimize f(x)  subject to constraints on x                     │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                             │\n│  By structure of f:                                                         │\n│  ┌───────────────┐  ┌───────────────┐  ┌───────────────┐                  │\n│  │   CONVEX      │  │  NON-CONVEX   │  │  COMBINATORIAL│                  │\n│  │               │  │               │  │               │                  │\n│  │ Local = global│  │ Many local min│  │ Discrete vars │                  │\n│  │ Poly-time     │  │ NP-hard often │  │ NP-hard often │                  │\n│  │ LP, QP, SOCP  │  │ Deep learning │  │ TSP, ILP      │                  │\n│  └───────────────┘  └───────────────┘  └───────────────┘                  │\n│                                                                             │\n│  By constraints:                                                            │\n│  ┌───────────────┐  ┌───────────────┐  ┌───────────────┐                  │\n│  │ UNCONSTRAINED │  │  EQUALITY     │  │  INEQUALITY   │                  │\n│  │               │  │               │  │               │                  │\n│  │ ∇f = 0        │  │ Lagrange mult │  │ KKT conditions│                  │\n│  │ Gradient desc │  │ h(x) = 0      │  │ g(x) ≤ 0      │                  │\n│  └───────────────┘  └───────────────┘  └───────────────┘                  │\n│                                                                             │\n│  Key algorithms by regime:                                                  │\n│  Convex+smooth → gradient descent, Newton, L-BFGS                         │\n│  Convex LP/QP  → simplex, interior point                                   │\n│  Non-convex    → SGD + variants (ML), simulated annealing, genetic algos  │\n│  Combinatorial → branch & bound, LP relaxation, heuristics                │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```"
    },
    {
