      },
      "text": "**The fundamental insight**: the structure of the problem (convex vs. non-convex,\nsmooth vs. non-smooth, constrained vs. unconstrained) determines both the\ndifficulty and the algorithm. Knowing which regime you're in is the first step."
    },
